# Agent config sync (Cursor + Kilo Code)

Rules and skills have **one canonical home**: `.cursor/rules/` and `.cursor/skills/`. Kilo Code reads the same paths via root `kilo.jsonc`; do not copy or symlink into `.kilo/` or `.kilocode/`.

## Adding or editing

- **Rules:** `.cursor/rules/<name>.mdc` with YAML frontmatter (`description`, optional `globs`, `alwaysApply`).
- **Skills:** `.cursor/skills/<name>/SKILL.md` — `name` in frontmatter must match the directory name; include `description`.

After any change to rules, skills, `kilo.jsonc`, or `AGENTS.md`, run:

```bash
pnpm lint:agent-config
```

## Forbidden (lint fails)

- Duplicate skill or rule trees: `.kilo/skills/`, `.kilo/rules/`, `.kilocode/`, `.agents/skills/` with project skills
- `kilo.jsonc` `skills.paths` or `instructions` pointing anywhere other than the canonical `.cursor/` paths and `AGENTS.md`
- Orphan skill directories without `SKILL.md`

## Portable index

`AGENTS.md` at repo root is a short index only — never paste full rule or skill bodies there.
